
[l_english.DECISION_C12_HELP_APPLELOOSA_REPAY_ITS_DEBT]
Help Appleloosa Repay Its Debt

[l_english.DECISION_C12_HELP_APPLELOOSA_REPAY_ITS_DEBT_desc]
The ripening of apples takes time and patience. We can use the bond funds at our hooves to help Appleloosa get through its difficulties and ease its immediate crisis.

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HELP_APPLELOOSA_REPAY_ITS_DEBT]
帮助苹果鲁萨还清债务

[l_simp_chinese.DECISION_C12_HELP_APPLELOOSA_REPAY_ITS_DEBT_desc]
苹果的成熟需要足够的时间和耐心，我们可以利用我们蹄上的债券基金帮助苹果鲁萨度过难关，缓解燃眉之急
